4
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:18.939
Today we learn about Basic Keyboard Shortcuts. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:24.907
Keyboard shortcut. Say it with me. Keyboard shortcut!

6
00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:32.423
Ctrl. Say it with me. Ctrl!

7
00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:39.840
Copy. Say it with me. Copy!

8
00:00:43.362 --> 00:00:47.028
Paste. Say it with me. Paste!

9
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.301
Undo. Say it with me. Undo!

10
00:00:57.773 --> 00:01:01.674
