13
00:01:20.853 --> 00:01:31.345
A keyboard shortcut uses a key combination, like Ctrl, to work efficiently. I can copy, paste, undo, or save quickly without using a mouse.

14
00:01:31.395 --> 00:01:35.421
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:36.482 --> 00:01:42.274
