Copy!

17
00:01:44.331 --> 00:01:49.535
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.585 --> 00:01:50.735
Efficient!

19
00:01:51.813 --> 00:01:59.246
Did you know? The undo shortcut, usually Ctrl+Z, can save you from many typing mistakes!

20
